# Keep line endings LF everywhere. Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true
# were rewriting reference prompts to CRLF; template literals normalise to LF
# at runtime, so the prompt-fidelity test (raw file bytes vs cooked string)
# then failed locally. LF in the working tree keeps local + CI identical.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pbf binary
*.pmtiles binary
